  messageTips: []
  titleOrMsg: 
  examineTitle: 
  paperText: 'HORROR I.VI KIT

    CLASSIFIED


    Dear Customer,

    We are glad
    that you bought the Horror FPS KIT as the base

    for your horror game. It
    is an advanced as easy-to-use

    horror game template with many features essential
    to

    creating your own horror game, including gameplay

    features seen
    in AA horror games of the last decade.


    If you have any questions about
    the kit, you can contact us via our website or via email.


    Website: www.twgamesdev.com

    Email:
    thunderwiregames@gmail.com


    Kind regards,

    ThunderWire Studio'
