  m_text: "When the earthquake starts, remember:\r\n1. DROP \u2014 get down low immediately\r\n2.
    COVER \u2014 get under the sturdy table inside the cabin\r\n3. HOLD ON \u2014
    protect your head until the shaking stops\n\r\nDo NOT run outside while it is
    still shaking \u2014 falling objects inside are safer than falling rocks outside!"
