  m_text: "\u2022 During an earthquake, DROP to the ground, take COVER under a sturdy
    table, and HOLD ON.\n\n\u2022 Stay away from windows, heavy furniture, and unsecured
    objects that may fall.\n\n\u2022 After shaking stops, check for injuries. Aftershocks
    may follow.\n\n\u2022 Move to open ground away from buildings and power lines.\n\n\u2022
    Know your evacuation route and assembly point before a disaster happens."
