  m_text: "Your goal is to survive and escape the mountainside safely. Remember:\r\n\r\n\u2022
    DROP, COVER, and HOLD ON when shaking starts\r\n\u2022 Turn OFF the gas valve
    \u2014 gas leaks cause fires and explosions\r\n\u2022 Collect food and medicine
